<title>INDIA: Cricket-India 237 and 7-1 v South Africa (177).</title>
<headline>Cricket-India 237 and 7-1 v South Africa (177).</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were seven for one wicket at the close of the second day of the third and final test against South Africa on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 7-1; South Africa 177.</p>
